# IDEs
.vscode
.idea/*
.DS_Store
.env

node_modules
target/
src/artifacts/
log/
store/*

codegenCache.json

# Local wallet state written by `aztec-wallet` / `aztec start --local-network` into the
# working directory: an LMDB store of accounts, salts and their keys. Per-machine, rewritten
# on every run, and never something a repository should carry.
aztec-wallet-data/

# Cache written by the `aztec` CLI wrapper: the list of environment variable names it forwards
# into its container. Machine-local, regenerated on demand, and specific to the installed CLI.
.latest_aztec_cli_vars

# TypeScript incremental build cache
tsconfig.tsbuildinfo

# Working deliverables of a tool-assisted audit: the threat model, the test-gap
# analysis, the raw findings file and the per-contract artifact surface dumps.
# Only the published report, CLAUDE_AUDIT.md, is committed — these stay local so
# that a `git add --all` cannot pull them in.
doc/audits/**/THREAT_MODEL.md
doc/audits/**/TEST_IMPROVEMENT.md
doc/audits/**/RESULT.md
doc/audits/**/surface/
